.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX01n0001_p0065a01","n":"0065a","t":"須有藉乎緣緣即是合乎生命"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX01n0001_p0066a01","n":"0066a","t":"四宇宙無實所顯真理實有自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX01n0001_p0067a01","n":"0067a","t":"第一種是行為的訓練害他則"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX01n0001_p0068a01","n":"0068a","t":"一佛學與宗教及科學情意的"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX01n0001_p0069a01","n":"0069a","t":"第五節怎樣研究佛學佛學的"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-太虛-第一編-佛學概論","source":"CBETA TX01n0001 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":527,"unit":"TX1 頁欄"}